Description: Provides a unified, programmatic interface for searching,
  browsing, and retrieving metadata from data repositories that use the
  National Data Archive ('NADA') software, such as the World Bank, 'FAO',
  the International Household Survey Network ('IHSN'), 'UNHCR', the World
  Health Organization, and the statistics offices of Kenya and Zambia.
  Functions discover available data collections, country codes, and access
  types, search by keyword, country, and year, and retrieve study metadata,
  file lists, and variable-level data dictionaries.
